<title>AUSTRIA: BBAG says '96 pre-tax up, raises dividend.</title>
<headline>BBAG says '96 pre-tax up, raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian drinks group BBAG said on Wednesday its final 1996 pre-tax profit rose to 1.304 billion schillings ($108.9 million) from 771 million schillings.</p>
<p>In a statement released ahead of a news conference BBAG said it planned to raise its 1996 dividend to 19 schillings from 17. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254 ($ = 11.96 Austrian Schillings)</p>
</text>
